OL,3,GNEWSATrio raise thousands after 'epic'
OL,4,Acharity challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women from Coventry have raised
OL,7,F#6,000 after taking part in an "epic"
OL,8,Fcharity 950-mile road trip in an old
OL,9,FHonda Civic.
OL,11,FDebbie Winstone, her sister-in-law
OL,12,FRebecca Winstone, and niece Rosaline
OL,13,FWinstone embarked on the Bangers and
OL,14,FCash challenge, driving from
OL,15,FChesterfield to Inverness and finishing
OL,16,Fback down in Whitby ` dressed up, and
OL,17,Ftaking on daily challenges on the way.
OL,19,FThe trio competed against other teams
OL,20,Fand ended up winning this year's annual
OL,21,Fevent.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
