OL,3,GNEWSATrio raise thousands after 'epic'
OL,4,Acharity challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The whole trip was fantastic, I am
OL,7,Fstill actually processing it because
OL,8,Fthere were so many challenges and so
OL,9,Fmuch fancy dress," Debbie told BBC CWR.
